{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17598","headline":"送张郎中副使自南省赴凤翔府幕 · 羊士谔","name":"送张郎中副使自南省赴凤翔府幕","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"仙郎佐氏谋，廷议宠元侯。\n城郭须来贡，河隍亦顺流。\n亚夫高垒静，充国大田秋。\n当奋燕然笔，铭功向陇头。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"羊士谔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17598.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17598","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}